flowchart LR
  subgraph DELIVERY[Offline DevSecOps delivery lane]
    M[Model artifact] --> SC[Fickling and ModelScan]
    SC --> SG[Cosign AI BOM signature]
    SG --> PA[OPA admission policy]
    PA --> C[Restricted local runtime]
  end

  subgraph ANSWER[Read-only answer lane]
    U[User request] --> G[Bounded gateway]
    G --> I[Input inspection and redaction]
    I --> R[Approved retrieval]
    R --> L[Scripted or local LLM]
    L --> O[Output validation]
    O --> A[Bounded answer with code-generated citations]
  end

  subgraph LAB[S5 authorization lab: separate from workload]
    Q[Fixed synthetic S5 request] --> B[Tool boundary]
    B -->|read-only request allowed| M[Local MCP search_docs]
    B -->|high-impact request denied| D[Decision recorded; not forwarded]
    H[Out-of-band human approval] --> B
    B -->|approval result| V[REVIEW only; no executor]
  end

  X[Scenario evidence with AISVS IDs] --> E[(evidence/A and evidence/B JSONL)]
  A --> X
  B --> X
  E --> S[Derived AISVS scorecard]

  C -. enforce .-> G
  C -. enforce .-> I
  C -. enforce .-> R
  C -. enforce .-> O
  C -. enforce .-> B
